{"full":"hf:build-small-hackathon/LifeChoice-Simulator","spaceId":"build-small-hackathon/LifeChoice-Simulator","name":"LifeChoice Simulator","source":"huggingface","description":"An interactive AI application on Hugging Face Spaces.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","build-small-hackathon","agent","decision-support","thousand-token-wood","best-agent","best-demo","openai","track:wood","sponsor:openai","achievement:offbrand","achievement:sharing","achievement:fieldnotes","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":4,"created":"2026-06-13T14:15:28.000Z","updated":"2026-06-15T21:26:44.000Z","license":"mit","runtime":"SLEEPING","appUrl":"https://build-small-hackathon-lifechoice-simulator.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/LifeChoice-Simulator","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T18:49:38.862Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T18:49:38.862Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T18:49:38.862Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🧭","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["LifeChoice Simulator is an LLM-powered interactive future game for the Thousand Token Wood track. It turns a real fork in the road into a strange, playable eight-node future where choices change the world, the character, the pressure, and the ending report.","The experience sits between a text-adventure dungeon master, a decision simulator, and a pocket-sized alternate-life RPG. A 7B model dreams up adaptive scenarios; deterministic game state keeps those dreams consequential.","Some decisions are too personal for a pros-and-cons list and too uncertain for a single chatbot answer. A student choosing between an MTech path and a software job is not only comparing two labels. They are carrying family expectations, money pressure, identity, validation, time, and fear of regret."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/LifeChoice-Simulator/blob/main/README.md","fi